# WORKFLOW CONTEXT

## STATES

- DRAFT
- APTO
- UNDER_REVIEW
- APPROVED
- SUPERSEDED

## FLOW

DRAFT → APTO → REVIEW → APPROVED

## RULES

- Only APTO can go to approval
- Approval affects entire thread
- Rejection creates new version

## CRITICAL

Approval is NOT per document
→ it is per THREAD